      "message": "fix(3d): Pass starts at on 3D Finish (Contour and Flat)\n\n3D Finish gets the shared pass_start field (#3316) with the same type,\nproject key (auto never written, no version step), digest writer, page\nrow and generic MCP door as 3D Pocket. Contour and Flat read it through\nthe new finishing3d::contour_from / flat_from doors: Inside cuts the\ninnermost offset pass first, Auto and Outside keep today's outside-in\norder move for move. The other patterns keep their moves and stamp and\nthe row names the pattern as not using the value. Geodesic is a\nfollow-up (#3624).\n\nFixes #3362\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
